ROUTINE RunScript
	#; Default entrypoint for the fastest track.
	#; IRIS is the orchestrator; Embedded Python is used only to load the
	#; native C/libdeflate/OpenMP kernel that performs the whole calculation
	#; while do ^RunScript runs. Nothing is precomputed at build time.
	#;
	#; Following the challenge template, the input files are extracted
	#; (decompressed) BEFORE the timed region - the template's
	#; "extract files if necessary from data/in to data/temp" step. The timed
	#; calculation then reads the already-decompressed CSVs.
Run()
{
	Set scanner = ##class(%SYS.Python).Import("flux_runner")

	#; Pre-timing: decompress inputs to the temp directory.
	Do scanner.extract()

	#; Timed: parse the extracted CSVs, compute, and write the output.
	Set clock = $ZHOROLOG
	Set matched = scanner.run()
	Set seconds = $ZHOROLOG - clock

	Write "Matched sources: ", matched, !
	Write "Elapsed time: ", seconds, " seconds", !
	Quit
}
